            "id": 10,
            "type": "markdown",
            "source": "### Step 4 — Two refusals nobody had to ask about\n\nAllow-listing a `destructive` tool changes nothing, and an unseen risk label denies rather than\nraising — and 5.6 imports a tool from a server you do not control."
